00D9                          ;*Macro unroll:  NEXT
00D9   F7                     DS   1-CPM,0F7h   
00DA                          DS   CPM,0C3h   
00DA                          DS   CPM,ANXT&0FFh   
00DA                          DS   CPM,ANXT/256   
00DA                             ; ---- where the two pages meet ----------------------------------------------
00DA                             ; The first page ends somewhere among the next four handlers, ] \ [ @ (they
00DA                             ; are in falling code order for this), and where exactly differs between the
00DA                             ; builds: NPG1 follows. Every handler below these four must start in the
00DA                             ; second page, and every one above in the first; chktab.py checks both.
00DA                             ; "]" returns: pop an address and jump to it. TOS is parked on the stack
00DA                             ; while rpop uses HL, and the drop at the end brings it back.
00DA   E5           H_RET:    PUSH   H   
