00DF                          DS   CPM,ADRP/256   
00DF                             ; "\" ( flag -- ): true skips to the next ")" or "]" at this level; ")"
00DF                             ; drops the block start, "]" returns. No closer at all ends the program.
00DF                             ; The flag stays in HL as the spent cell that rdrop and ret2 drop.
00DF   7C           H_BREAK:   MOV   A,H   
