0178                          DS   CPM,ANXT/256   
0178                             ; "/" ( a b -- q r ): the remainder is on top. Truncates toward zero; r takes
0178                             ; a's sign. Divide |a| by |b|, then q gets the sign of a XOR b and r the sign
0178                             ; of a. Dividing by zero returns two cells of no meaning; the checked build
0178                             ; stops on it.
0178                H_DIV:       
0178                          IF   CHECKED   
                              MOV   A,H   
                              ORA   L   
